  "description": "First introduced in June of 1963, the Sting-Ray quickly went on to become the most beloved kid’s bike in the US. This iconic American classic is back for a new generation to love. With familiar features including a steel frame, rigid fork, high-rise ape handlebars, racing slick rear tire, and that classic banana seat you remember.\nThis bicycle is ready to ride for children and adults alike. With a single-speed drivetrain and intuitive rear coaster brakes, the Sting-Ray is simple to use and maintain. From your childhood to theirs, create lasting biking memories with the Sting-Ray. Enjoy the freedom of riding a Schwinn.",
